id=m54tuner
name=PUCTuner (M54 / Exynos 1380)
version=v0.13.0
versionCode=15
author=orkgabb
description=Closed-loop DVFS for this specific unit. A PUCT planner searches a value model trained on its own measured windows - frame pacing, eBPF runqueue delay, PSI, paging, watts, die heat - then raises CPU/GPU/bus floors only where it measured a gain, and refuses where it did not. Every write journaled and reversible.
